      propertyPath: _phoneDialogue._sentences.Array.size
      value: 6
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8196108908081059474, guid: b8ceb81b5084bb641abe39cd9050cf19,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: _finishedDialogue._sentences.Array.size
      value: 1
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8196108908081059474, guid: b8ceb81b5084bb641abe39cd9050cf19,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: '_phoneDialogue._sentences.Array.data[0]'
      value: You took the pictures? Thanks pal, I knew I could count on you!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8196108908081059474, guid: b8ceb81b5084bb641abe39cd9050cf19,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: '_phoneDialogue._sentences.Array.data[1]'
      value: Your is surprise waiting for you in the living room, but you need to
        do one last favor for me first...
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8196108908081059474, guid: b8ceb81b5084bb641abe39cd9050cf19,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: '_phoneDialogue._sentences.Array.data[2]'
      value: 'Can you go ahead and take a picture of the phone? '
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8196108908081059474, guid: b8ceb81b5084bb641abe39cd9050cf19,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: '_phoneDialogue._sentences.Array.data[3]'
      value: ...
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8196108908081059474, guid: b8ceb81b5084bb641abe39cd9050cf19,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: '_phoneDialogue._sentences.Array.data[4]'
      value: '...you know I''m not really your mom, right? '
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8196108908081059474, guid: b8ceb81b5084bb641abe39cd9050cf19,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: '_phoneDialogue._sentences.Array.data[5]'
      value: Goodnight buddy...
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8196108908081059474, guid: b8ceb81b5084bb641abe39cd9050cf19,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: '_finishedDialogue._sentences.Array.data[0]'
      value: The line is dead...
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8196108908081059474, guid: b8ceb81b5084bb641abe39cd9050cf19,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: _phoneDialogueMorning._sentences.Array.size
      value: 5
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8196108908081059474, guid: b8ceb81b5084bb641abe39cd9050cf19,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: '_phoneDialogueMorning._sentences.Array.data[0]'
      value: Well, if it isn't the birthday boy! I've been waiting around all day
        for a call from you...
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8196108908081059474, guid: b8ceb81b5084bb641abe39cd9050cf19,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: '_phoneDialogueMorning._sentences.Array.data[1]'
      value: I swung by again this morning to grab the rest of our stuff. It's a
        bummer to see the house so empty...
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8196108908081059474, guid: b8ceb81b5084bb641abe39cd9050cf19,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: '_phoneDialogueMorning._sentences.Array.data[2]'
      value: Anyways, I have a surprise waiting for you, but first you'll need to
        take just a few more pictures.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8196108908081059474, guid: b8ceb81b5084bb641abe39cd9050cf19,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: '_phoneDialogueMorning._sentences.Array.data[3]'
      value: Can you do that for me, pal? I'm sure your sick of that old camera,
